
================================================================================
EXTERNAL VALIDATION ANALYSIS - DEFENSE OF ORIGINAL METHODOLOGY
================================================================================

This demonstrates the CORRECT validation approach for small datasets:
  1. Hold out 20% as external test set (NEVER touched during development)
  2. Use 80% for model development (including hyperparameter tuning)
  3. Report honest performance on external test set

This avoids underfitting from nested CV while maintaining honest validation.
